WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.280
¡Se lo ruego, doctor!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.400
You're a professional!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.520
Yes, I'm professional.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.320
That's the point!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.600
Besides, I took an oath!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.680
Now, out!

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.280
But it's about giving her hope.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.520
You just tell her that

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.680
she can have children.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.560
Is that so hard?

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.680
In medicine, predictions

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.720
aren’t based on hope.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.360
Here, we deal only in facts.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.960
But it... it's miracle right now.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Isn't that the best time

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.680
for a little dream?

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.360
What?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.680
No, no, no!

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.360
Alright.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.560
Mr. Henderson.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.320
Dr. Ramirez.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.880
Please welcome.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:40.720
Thank you.
